# The context is the repository root, which holds .env, the registry in .data and the client's projects. Only
# web/ gets in, without what is regenerated inside the image or the tests' data (ADR-0040).
*
!web/
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/.next-*
web/e2e/.data
web/e2e/.results
web/next-env.d.ts
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
web/**/.env*
